+*   **Memory Footprint:** The buffer size grows exponentially with dimension if not managed as a circular FIFO. The specific formula for $R^4$ is $X_M \cdot Y_M \cdot Z_M + X_M \cdot Y_M + X_M + 1$ [S1, unofficial].
